# Code owners for metrolivemap.
# A matching PR auto-requests review from the listed owner.
#
# Note: GitHub never requests review from a PR's own author, so for a solo
# maintainer this mainly takes effect for outside contributors. It also
# documents ownership and backs the optional "Require review from Code
# Owners" branch-protection rule if more maintainers are added later.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                       @orenbj

# Motion model + feed ingestion are the highest-risk areas — call them out
# explicitly so they stay owned even if the default line is ever narrowed.
/js/markers.js          @orenbj
/js/api.js              @orenbj
/js/tripUpdates.js      @orenbj
/.github/workflows/     @orenbj
